{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/About_This_Game.png?t=1749483738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dead Station Files</strong> is a turn\u2011based roguelike about surviving on a doomed space station, experienced entirely through the  <strong>Evacom\u2122</strong> <strong>\u2014 </strong>portable emergency<strong>\u00a0</strong>\u200bterminal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Events and crew narratives are captured as Evacom\u2122 data files, recorded by each character from their perspective. Load any file to live through that crew member\u2019s final run and stitch together the full picture of the catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catastrophe via Evacom\u2122</strong>\u00a0<strong>:\u00a0</strong>The entire experience plays out within the Evacom\u2122 terminal, letting you relive the space station\u2019s collapse from the perspective of its crew.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/StationScreen.gif?t=1749483738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every level is generated 100% solvable puzzle:</strong> Advance level by level, compartment by compartment \u2014 until you reach the exit\u2026 or run out of time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/levels.gif?t=1749483738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-based tactics:</strong> Plan your moves, avoid deadly threats, and manage limited resources under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/First_gameplay.gif?t=1749483738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Death at every turn:</strong> You will die. A lot. A space catastrophe is no place for fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/Station_Death.gif?t=1749483738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Conduct your own investigation:</strong> Organize recovered data and reconstruct the true timeline of the disaster, unlocking new characters and gameplay modes as you piece together the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/Catalog.gif?t=1749483738\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time is your greatest enemy:</strong>\u00a0You can influence the flow of events, but you can\u2019t stop the catastrophe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/extras/Time.gif?t=1749483738\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687410?t=1749483738","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/1adc6c58b6ae584df87683f4c23930e140747ae8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749483738","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/6a513616c99146056b16234d8f33837843972e2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749483738","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687410/6a513616c99146056b16234d8f33837843972e2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749483738","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"co